  "solution": "Logic :\n\n \n• (1st number × 2) = 2nd number\n \n• 3rd number - 2nd number = 22\n\nGiven : \n\n \n• (16, 32, 54)\n\n16 × 2 = 32\n\n32 = 32 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n54 - 32 = 22\n\n22 = 22 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• (29, 58, 80)\n\n16 × 2 = 32\n\n32 = 32 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n54 - 32 = 22\n\n22 = 22 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n \n• Option - (1) : (17, 35, 59)\n\n17 × 2 = 35\n\n34 ≠ 34 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n59 - 35 = 22\n\n24 ≠ 22 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (2) : (25, 50, 62)\n\n25 × 2 = 50\n\n50 = 50 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n62 - 50 = 22\n\n12 ≠ 22 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (3) : (24, 48, 70)\n\n24 × 2 = 48\n\n**48 = 48 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nAnd,\n\n70 - 48 = 22\n\n**22 = 22 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (4) : (23, 46, 62)\n\n23 × 2 = 46\n\n46 = 46 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n62 - 46 = 22\n\n16 ≠ 22 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
